// CRE Grade 8 depth pass (18 Nov 2026). As in Grade 7, the first pass gave every misconception one stock cause and a repair equal
// to the child's line, only 4 prerequisites in all, and examples no learner would pick; two had right and wrong swapped
// (M_CR8_PL_SINS, M_CR8_CM_FED). Each now has a real error, a believable wrong answer, the learner's reason and a repair. Four new
// skills carry the testable outcomes that had none (causes of sin today and overcoming temptation; covenants today and discerning
// ungodly ones; teenage pregnancy and its consequences; threats to life and the values that uphold it). The sensitive ones are for
// a CRE teacher and the school counsellor to read first. Merged by scripts/build-cre-grade.mjs 8. Draft until reviewed.
