      M_CR8_CS_FAITH: M('The disciples are heroes in the learner\'s mind.', 'Read Mark 4:40: "Why are you so afraid? Do you still have no faith?"', 'Thinks Jesus praised the disciples for their faith, instead of asking why they had so little.'),
